&HEAD CHID='bndf_global', TITLE='Global boundary data arrays for fdsreader' /
&MESH ID='Fine', IJK=10,10,10, XB=0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /
&MESH ID='Coarse', IJK=5,5,5, XB=1.0,2.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /
&TIME T_END=2.0 /
&DUMP DT_BNDF=0.5, SMOKE3D=F /
&REAC FUEL='PROPANE' /
&SURF ID='FIRE', HRRPUA=500.0 /
&VENT XB=0.1,0.5,0.1,0.9,0.0,0.0, SURF_ID='FIRE' /
&VENT MB='XMIN', SURF_ID='OPEN' / &VENT MB='XMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT MB='ZMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /

Across both meshes: the top at z = 0.53 snaps to 0.5 in 'Fine' and to 0.6 in 'Coarse'
&OBST ID='Table', XB=0.6,1.4,0.2,0.8,0.0,0.53 /
One cell wide in x
&OBST ID='Strip', XB=0.2,0.3,0.2,0.8,0.0,0.3 /

&BNDF QUANTITY='WALL TEMPERATURE' /
&BNDF QUANTITY='NET HEAT FLUX', CELL_CENTERED=T /
&TAIL /
